{"id":"n71308-1-8","stage":2,"title":"파일 · 文件夹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71308-1-8-1","ko":"이 파일들은 다 뭐야?","zh":"这些文件都是些什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"파일들은","meaning":"文件夹","explanation":"파일：文件夹；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"파일","audio":"/audio/0c8354d0e51a08b2736d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71308","senseId":"1","lemma":"파일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파일들은","audio":"/audio/6748627fba2647ac6bc2.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"0c8354d0e51a08b2","term":"파일","zh":"文件夹","audio":"/audio/0c8354d0e51a08b2736d.mp3","entryId":"71308","definition":"用于把文件聚集在一起装整的工具，或指如此装整起来的一捆文件。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/8470940d77d683fb3b32.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71308-1-8-2","ko":"내가 낸 기획서들을 다 모아 둔 거야.","zh":"是我之前提交的那些策划书都汇总在一起了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"낸","meaning":"交，提交，发","explanation":"내다：交，提交，发；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"14","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낸","audio":"/audio/6e929f03863b78fd01a8.mp3"}},{"text":"기획서들을","meaning":"策划书","explanation":"기획서：策划书；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기획서","audio":"/audio/977bd8af59da2dc555c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:기획서:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"기획서","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기획서들을","audio":"/audio/aa9d56c1fed6ab4d34ae.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"모아","meaning":"集，聚，聚集","explanation":"모으다：集，聚，聚集；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"1","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모아","audio":"/audio/49ed4378fb75ee9006e5.mp3"}},{"text":"둔","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；